HTTP 400
{"detail":"period must be a single timeslot code (123456789ABCDEF), got 'Z'"}

Same 400-with-clear-message contract for the other illegal params (covered in tests):
grade=9 → "grade must be one of 0, 1, 2, 3, 4 (0 = 不分年級), got '9'"
weekday=8 → "weekday must be 1 (Mon) .. 7 (Sun), got 8"
period without weekday → "period requires weekday (the day to match on)"
unknown param name → "unknown query parameter 'X'; supported: compulsory, credit, dept, english, grade, page, period, q, weekday, year_sem"
